The '''Gacha Probability Up Campaign''' (確率アップキャンペーン, ''Kakuritsu Appukyanpēn'', '''Probability Up Campaign''') is an event that doubles the chances for [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rares]] and [[:Category:Legend Rare Cats|Legend Rares]] to drop from the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]].

==Event==
A limited time chance for mighty rare Cats!<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''On March 17th (11:00am) through March 24th (10:59am)!'''}}

Only during this event, your chance of collecting a Uber or Legend-grade Cat at the Rare Capsules is doubled!

