==See Also==
*[[Guaranteed Uber Rare Cat Campaign]]: A similar event that guarantees an Uber Rare will drop on the 11th roll of any 1,500 [[Cat Food]] draw.

==Trivia==
*The Guaranteed Uber Rare Campaign and Gacha Probability Up Campaign are mutually exclusive and will not occur at the same time.
*Some Gacha Events have a built-in increased chance for Uber Rares or Legend Rares, such as [[UBERFEST (Gacha Event)|UBERFEST]], [[EPICFEST (Gacha Event)|EPICFEST]] and [[RoyalFest (Gacha Event)|RoyalFest]].
*Like the Guaranteed Uber Rare Campaign, the Gacha Probability Up Campaign is usually exclusive with earning a Platinum Shard from 1,500 Cat Food rolls.
*The Event Data has a typo, it should say "'''an''' Uber", but instead it says "'''a''' Uber".

